    "caption": "Today, Almaty Hub hosted a meetup with Nurasyl Serik, Co-founder & CEO of RemoFirst — a global HR platform that enables companies to hire employees in more than 185 countries worldwide.\n\nDuring the meetup, participants explored how startups with Kazakhstani roots can expand into international markets, attract investment from global venture capital firms, build products for a worldwide audience, and scale their businesses beyond a single country.\n\nThe speaker also shared insights from building an international HR-tech company, discussed key decisions that drive growth, and highlighted the importance of thinking globally from the earliest stages of a startup’s journey.",
